WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Disrobe: see the software underneath.
Recover source, structure and unpacked bytes.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Recognize the packed executable
Inspect the file's packer evidence before choosing a recovery path.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Unpack the native payload
Recover the UPX payload as a separate binary.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Open the application container
Extract the APK's archive members into a directory.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Let Disrobe choose the passes
Keep the recovery report and each executed stage's output.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Recover Python from bytecode
Decompile the code object without invoking Python for a round-trip check.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Read the Lua program
Turn the compiled chunk into Lua source.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Separate the bundled modules
Split the Webpack bundle into individual module files.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Restore the embedded originals
Write the original sources retained in the source map.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Read WebAssembly instructions
The WAT retains the exported add function and its i32.add instruction.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Decode Android resources
Read the package, resource names and decoded manifest.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Extract indicators
Find the URL, email address and documentation-range IP in these input bytes.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:16.000
Inspect the original strings
List printable strings with decoding disabled.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:22.000
Review the chain's verdict
Read the pass status and producer-reported recovery tiers.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:28.000
Export the completed run
Save a Markdown report from the existing recovery directory.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:34.000
Package the original bytes
Create a Raw-rung envelope carrying the WebAssembly input.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Verify the envelope hash
Check the stored payload against its BLAKE3 root hash.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:46.000
Create an IDE workspace
Generate the workspace and Claude integration files in this project.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:52.000
Keep a named analyst note
Record the proposed symbol name separately from recovered evidence.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:58.000
Write the project configuration
Generate the documented configuration template.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:04.000
Add shell completions
Generate the Bash completion script as a file.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:12.000
Continue with the recovered files, reports and your own tools.
